    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This attractive four-bedroom semi-detached home extends to 138 sq m and has been designed and configured to deliver a peerless living experience.Externally, its aesthetically appealing front elevation perfectly marries Oldtown Multi Antique brickwork with complimentary plastering, while the warm triple glazing and composite hall doors deliver on both a visual and functional level. Ample private off-street parking with provision for electric car charging, clearly defined boundaries and a secure gate to the fully fenced rear garden completes the exterior.Internally, generous room proportions are immediately evident, with all areas fully painted. Quality joinery, sumptuous bathrooms and its modern kitchen designs are sure to appeal.Comfort is assured within the highly insulated envelope, while the latest air-to-water heat pump and control system guarantees this comfort is delivered in the most efficient manner."
      },
